     1505   field max-plu       as integer
     1506   field num-fields    as integer
     1507   field task-num      as character
     1508   field by-record     as logical
     1509   field send-get      as character
     1510   field cash-num      as integer
     1511   field cash-num-char as character
     1512   field port-num      as character
     1513   field way           as character
     1514   field is-script     as logical
     1515   field pswd          as character
     1516   field waiting-sek   as integer
     1517   field other-info    as character
     1518   field order-num     as integer
     1519   field secondary     as integer
     1520   field shift-fields  as integer
     1521   field binary        as logical
